  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to WFP Lebanon for social protection and cash assistance for the emergency response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will have three sub-components all related to the current Lebanon emergency response:
a.	multi-purpose cash assistance for Syrian refugees
b.	multi-purpose cash assistance for Lebanese funded through the Shock Responsive Safety Net (SRSN)
c.	social protection (SP) technical assistance (TA) for the emergency response</narrative>
  </description>
